### R1. Coordinator header still describes a two-phase coordinator; there are three
`ThumbnailMigrationCoordinator.swift:11-16` and `:44`

Line 5 was correctly updated, but `:11-16` still enumerates exactly two jobs, and the header (`:1-57`) never mentions `runHistoryPhase` (`:506-600`) — a full second pass over `ZSDHISTORYRECORD` with its own scanner, its own stubborn accounting, and a shared write budget. This is the largest single addition in the PR and is invisible from the file header.

`:44` — "**幂等可中断**：下一次启动从 displayThumbnail == nil 的余量继续" — is stale. Resumption is now driven by a three-way union predicate (`ProjectImageCompactionScanner.swift:96-99`): oversized `thumbnail`, oversized `finishedImage`, or missing `displayThumbnail`. Suggest `下一次启动按扫描谓词重新取余量（超阈值的 thumbnail / finishedImage，或缺 displayThumbnail），不是游标翻页`.

### R2. Every cited measurement is unpinned, and one is mislabelled
None of these appear in any test or source outside the comment itself: `12,975,516 → 1,560,605` (`ProjectImageEncoder.swift:17`), `1,429,323` / `4,318,567` (`:135-136`), `5,840,831` (`:336`), `228 KB` / `1.05 MB` (`:46-47`, `:296`), `935 MB` (`:178`), `0.0156 MB` (`InventoryManager.swift:4165`). The corresponding tests assert only relative bounds and `print()` the actual values (`ProjectImageEncoderTests.swift:208`, `ProjectImageCompactionScannerTests.swift:117`, `StoreCompactionIntegrationTests.swift:165-170`). Each will silently rot on the next Core Image / libjpeg / SDK change.

One is worse than unpinned. `:17` labels `12,975,516 B` as **真机实测** (measured on a real device). `StoreCompactionIntegrationTests.swift:52` describes the *synthetic* `makeFullResolutionPNG(longEdge: 2400)` fixture as "实测 2400px 出 ~12.9 MB" — and 12,975,516 B is 12.9 MB decimal. Meanwhile `:17` gives the recompressed result as 1,560,605 B while `ProjectImageEncoderTests.swift:~184` says the noise fixture "实测停在 ~1.4 MB" and `:135` reports 1,429,323 B for what appears to be the same fixture. Either the header pair is from a genuine device photo (in which case name the device/source, because the number collides exactly with the synthetic fixture) or the "真机" label is wrong and should read `测试夹具实测（makeFullResolutionPNG 2400px）`.

### R3. `ProjectImageEncoder.swift:36-37` — minor mechanism imprecision
"（平均 Lab 只喂 near-white 预过滤，不参与色号判定）" — the near-white prefilter *does* decide the colour code: `GridCellSampler.swift:146-147` sets `matchedCode = "H2"` outright. And "2/8 的投票门槛也会把它吸收掉" credits the wrong mechanism: noise resistance comes from plurality (`votes.max`, `:149`); the `>= 2` at `:150` is a minimum-confidence floor that only rejects a lone stray vote. Suggest `平均 Lab 不参与投票匹配，只用于 near-white 预过滤（该分支会直接判 H2，见 GridCellSampler:146）；抗噪靠的是 8 点多数票（votes.max），≥2 只是防止单个孤立票胜出的下限。`

